{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<h5>被控一項「殘酷對待動物」罪</h5>\n<p>被告 NGATIYAH（40 歲，報稱家傭），被控於 2026 年 6 月 17 至 18 日之間，在觀塘將軍澳道 4 號觀塘紀律部隊宿舍 2 座某室殘酷地打，或因胡亂或不合理地作出或不作出某種作為，而導致三隻貓，分別品種為「英國短毛貓」即蒲蒲、品種為「英國長毛貓」即糖糖及麻糬，受到任何不必要的痛苦。</p>\n<blockquote>KTCC1250/2026</blockquote>\n<blockquote>KTCC1250/2026</blockquote>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T05:18:29.850183+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":0,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T05:11:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T05:58:13.503112+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"39cfad59ac9d393dcd5a2c5f4c142417d31ad2d4f72b00ec46b382aad7f602b3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}